\section{GitHub Copilot Billing Data}
\label{app:billing}

\hl{This appendix provides the complete daily GitHub Copilot billing records used in the cost analysis in} Section~\ref{sec:cost}\hl{. Data were exported from the GitHub billing dashboard on March~9, 2026. The} \texttt{copilot\_premium\_request} \hl{SKU covers all premium AI model requests (Claude Opus~4.6, GPT~5.3, GPT Codex~5.4) at \$0.04/request list price. GitHub Actions rows reflect CI/CD pipeline execution minutes at \$0.006/minute; all Actions usage was covered by the free-tier allocation (net \$0). Columns: Date; Product (copilot / actions); Qty (requests or minutes); Gross (\$); Discount (\$); Net (\$).}

