%% agreed..." or report the actual fraction if data was collected.
%%
%% RISKY CLAIM: "scorer correctly identified" — "correctly" implies ground truth. The
%% ground truth is the developer's own judgment, which was not formally collected.
%% This is circular: the scorer agreed with informal observation, not an independent label.
