\textit{Qualitative validation.} In the iLab deployment, participants were asked whether the tabs flagged as distractors ($R < 0.3$) by \texttt{/optimize} were ones they would have manually closed. %% RISKY CLAIM: "The majority agreed" — no count, no formal survey, no Likert scale.
