C7 & Compilation dependencies & Node.js $\geq$~18, VS~Code $\geq$~1.99; Extension: \texttt{@anthropic-ai/tokenizer}, \texttt{js-tiktoken}; MCP/CLI: \texttt{@modelcontextprotocol/sdk}, \texttt{zod} \\
